# Bundled music: WAVs are large + deterministically regenerated from
# scripts/generate_music.py. We commit the small precomputed *.beatmap.json so
# the pipeline stays deterministic; run `make setup` (or generate_music.py) to
# (re)create the audio on a fresh clone. Swap in real licensed audio anytime.
backend/assets/music/*.wav
backend/assets/music/*.mp3
backend/sample_trip/

